Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:47.90,H_id,,0,0,0,,"Minggir. Kamu injak LUBANG DARAHKU." Dia datang untuk membatalkan tunangan.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:47.90,C_id,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episode GRATIS ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.84,S_id,,0,0,0,,Hari ini, DIA berani membatalkan tunangan duluan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:02.90,S_id,,0,0,0,,Minggir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:03.88,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kamu menginjak lubang darahku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:04.82,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kamu—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:07.93,S_id,,0,0,0,,Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:09.98,S_id,,0,0,0,,Hari ini aku datang untuk membatalkan tunangan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.41,0:00:12.37,S_id,,0,0,0,,Keluarga Yun memilihmu karena kau seorang sarjana,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.41,0:00:13.77,S_id,,0,0,0,,dan terpaksa menerima jodoh ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.81,0:00:14.71,S_id,,0,0,0,,Sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:15.81,S_id,,0,0,0,,Miskin sampai merebus batu untuk makan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:16.97,S_id,,0,0,0,,tapi menggali kuburan sendiri di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.01,0:00:17.91,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kalau orang tahu,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:19.09,S_id,,0,0,0,,muka keluarga Yun hancur karena kamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.13,0:00:20.03,S_id,,0,0,0,,Persis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.07,0:00:21.01,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kodok bermimpi makan daging angsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.05,0:00:22.33,S_id,,0,0,0,,Orang miskin seperti kamu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:24.41,S_id,,0,0,0,,tak layak untuk harta berharga seperti Yun Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.41,0:00:26.72,S_id,,0,0,0,,Om,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:28.20,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kenapa marah pada sampah begini?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:29.24,S_id,,0,0,0,,Bisa mengotori tangan Anda.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:30.28,S_id,,0,0,0,,Di dingin seperti ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:31.80,S_id,,0,0,0,,hanya mansionku di kota
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:33.00,S_id,,0,0,0,,yang bisa memberimu kehangatan sejati.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:34.16,S_id,,0,0,0,,Gudang bawah tanah keluarga Ho
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.40,S_id,,0,0,0,,dipenuhi batu bara untuk sepanjang musim dingin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:37.40,S_id,,0,0,0,,Pindah ke sana,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:38.44,S_id,,0,0,0,,bahkan jika langit runtuh,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.04,S_id,,0,0,0,,satu jarimu pun tak akan beku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.62,0:00:42.70,S_id,,0,0,0,,Lempar kertas pernikahannya ke sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.74,0:00:43.86,S_id,,0,0,0,,Lalu kalian bisa pergi dari sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.66,0:00:45.78,S_id,,0,0,0,,Apa yang kamu bilang?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:46.72,S_id,,0,0,0,,Aku bilang
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:47.90,S_id,,0,0,0,,lempar kertas pernikahannya ke sini.
